# This repo keeps every document at the root (README.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, …). A `docs/`
# directory here has only ever meant one thing: private material staged in the wrong tree.
# A copy of the internal PRD sat here untracked-but-unignored on 2026-08-13, one `git add -A`
# away from being published. gitleaks would not have caught it — strategy is not a secret,
# it is just not ours to publish.
/docs/
